  "description": "OpenTelemetry integration for REslava.Result. Seeds ResultContext.CorrelationId from the active span's TraceId and OperationName from its DisplayName via .WithOpenTelemetry(). Writes error tags as span attributes on pipeline failure via .WriteErrorTagsToSpan(). Zero cost when no active span is present — checks Activity.Current == null before any allocation.",
